-name>, <string-name><surname>Osmond</surname> <given-names>DH</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Masae Kawamura</surname> <given-names>L</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Daley</surname> <given-names>CL</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>A 13-year molecular epidemiological analysis of tuberculosis in San Francisco.</article-title><source>Int J Tuberc Lung Dis</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>10</volume>:<fpage>297</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>304</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16562710</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R5"><label>5. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Jasmer</surname> <given-names>RM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hahn</surname> <given-names>JA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Small</surname> <given-names>PM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Daley</surname> <given-names>CL</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Behr</surname> <given-names>MA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Moss</surname> <given-names>AR</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>A molecular epidemiologic analysis of tuberculosis trends in San Francisco, 1991&#x02013;1997.</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source> <year>1999</year>;<volume>130</volume>:<fpage>971</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10383367</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R6"><label>6. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Geng</surname> <given-names>E</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Kreiswirth</surname> <given-names>B</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Driver</surname> <given-names>C</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Li</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Burzynski</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>DellaLatta</surname> <given-names>P</given-names></string-name>,